WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.548
(uptempo music)

00:00:02.548 --> 00:00:05.097
- Thanks so much guys
for meeting me today.

00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:07.769
I am so hungover, I had like
eight vodka sodas last night,

00:00:07.769 --> 00:00:09.116
maybe nine.

00:00:09.116 --> 00:00:10.218
- Oh my god, I know.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:12.030
I went to this new whiskey bar downtown

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.654
and then to an after hours.

00:00:13.654 --> 00:00:15.919
I didn't get home 'til
like five in the morning.

00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:16.953
- Oh my god you guys,

00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:18.810
I met the cutest guy
at the club last night.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.912
It turns out he has a private jet.

00:00:20.912 --> 00:00:22.920
We're going to Hawaii next weekend.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.578
- Oh my god, I'm so jealous.

00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:29.109
Hannah, anything fun happen with you?

00:00:30.969 --> 00:00:35.759
- Oh, actually this morning
I was changing his diaper

00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:38.686
and I found a whole blueberry inside.

00:00:38.686 --> 00:00:40.624
Like the whole thing.

00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:42.807
And I even dug it out, I
like totally dug it out

00:00:42.807 --> 00:00:45.686
and saw all the sides of it
and it was perfectly round.

00:00:45.686 --> 00:00:47.347
I don't know, I still can't figure it out.

00:00:48.877 --> 00:00:50.604
Does anybody want bread?

00:00:52.037 --> 00:00:53.012
- Sure.

00:00:53.012 --> 00:00:53.871
- You could use some.

00:00:53.871 --> 00:00:57.070
(uptempo music)

